      "text": "[7:12PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Dangote U-turn inward Mobil Ashade down to Akilo. Fumec inward Acme junction down to Metal Box is moving at a fast pace. \nIjaye road is busy due to alternation and return journey influx. Guinness inward Akanni Doherty down to Mangoro Ashade is moving fast. Capitol inward Oniwaya junction down to Alfa Nla is steady. \nOld Ipaja road and Old Abeokuta road are busy due to alternation, but some sections are moving fast. No impediments reported, and traffic officials are on ground managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
