      "text": "[7:46PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Cement inward Dopemu underneath the bridge to Adealu Goye intersection inward Alaguntan Alimosho road.\n\nAkiwowo, Cash Street, and Moshalashi are experiencing good traffic flow in both directions. Dopemu bridge inward Akowonjo roundabout, ShaSha, Cele, Shobo, Kwara, Jimoh, and Vulcanizer are all moving smoothly. \n\nHowever, approaching Micom is slow.\nTraffic is busy from Bakery, Ogunlana junction to Egbeda due to commercial activities. \n\nThe return journey from Egbeda to Lagos-Abeokuta Expressway and Babajide Sanwo-Olu road to Agbotikuyo is calm. \nOniwaya road is good.\nNo impediments have been reported, and our officers are on ground managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
