      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1977091111488311381",
      "text": "[8:12PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from UBA roundabout towards NNPC filling station and from Cathedral Church down to Nitel intersection. \nThere's uninterrupted movement from State House frontage to McWen Bridge connecting Force Road. \nTraffic is flowing well from Onikan roundabout towards TBS and Water Board connecting Nitel intersection. \nThe stretch from Zone 2 underneath the bridge to Flagstaff House, McWen Bridge, Officers Mess, and Bonny Camp is moving perfectly. Broad Street, Bookshop, Tinubu Square, Abibu Oki, Martins Junction, and Davies Street are all looking good.\nThere's slow and steady movement after Balogun traffic light towards Apongbon underneath due to commercial activities. Igbosere Road and Catholic Mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street are moving well. Our personnel are visible, monitoring the situation, and there's no impediment reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
