      "text": "🇵🇭 Earthquake aftermath on Mindanao: magnitude 7.4, flooding and building damage, October 10, 2025\n\n🌍 On October 10, a powerful magnitude 7.4 earthquake struck the island of Mindanao (Philippines). According to meteorologists, the epicenter was offshore, and tremors were felt across the region.\n🌊 Water poured into coastal areas, and several vehicles were submerged. Fire Chief Jardar Afret reported that water likely entered at least one building.\n🆘 Emergency crews are working to assess the damage and assist affected residents.\n\n⏰ Since the end of 2024 our planet has entered  the 12,000-year cycle. We as humanity are not ready for this, neither scientifically, nor technically or in terms of morality and humaneness. But we still have a little bit of time left to curb the climatic Cerberus....  🌀\n\n👀 To learn more about the reasons of the increasing natural disasters and the way out of it, read the report ON THE PROGRESSION OF CLIMATIC DISASTERS ON EARTH AND THEIR CATASTROPHIC CONSEQUENCES\n🔴 https://t.co/17otvN87Jr\n\n#CreativeSociety #GlobalCrisis\n#Responsibility #ActNow #SPEAKUP\n#Philippines #Mindanao #earthquake #tsunami #weather #climate #destruction #anomaly #climatechange #NaturalDisasters",
